sentences.l:
For before Patroclus met his fated day,
so long to spare somewhat was dearer to me in my wits
of the Trojans, and many alive I took and sold;

and Achilles, drawing his sharp sword,
struck him at the collar-bone beside the neck, and all within him
sank the double-edged sword;

and not you your mother,
having laid you on a bed, will lament, but Scamander
will carry you, the eddying one, into the broad bosom of the sea;

Meanwhile Peleus’ son, holding his long-shadowed spear,
leapt at Asteropaeus, eager to kill him,
the son of Pelegon;
